(c)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/5b006915e3b3972ba32a66d187d0359576ba5183.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":14,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n Consider the circuit shown below,</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/8c06909bce69cfd0956f861d2387fb2da75a228d.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n transistor parameters are: <img src=\"/media/981cd9983ad41a43d22f1bb2621e81e2b1997142.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> and</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/fe7c6cd215dad059322361a8b2e6f698e05d626b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n The value of <em>V<sub>o</sub></em> for <img src=\"/media/56ca0f00d35bcf15d5414dd55f2d5e516eddc06a.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> is _________ V. (Rounded off to two decimal places)</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"0.08","high":"0.12"},"solution":"<p>\n 0.10 (0.08 - 0.12)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/4fc718a69aada40537399b91d26ea752351a12aa.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":15,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n The value of the corner frequency of a MOSFET amplifier shown below is _______ MHz.<br />\n (Rounded off to two decimal places)</p>\n<p>\n For the circuit, the parameters are: <em>R<sub>s</sub></em> = 3.2 kΩ, <em>R<sub>D</sub></em> = 10 kΩ, <em>R<sub>L</sub></em> = 20 kΩ and <em>C<sub>L</sub></em> = 10 pF.<br />\n The transistor parameters are: <em>V<sub>TP</sub></em> = –2 V, <em>K<sub>p</sub></em> = 0.25 mA/V<sup>2</sup> and <img src=\"/media/618f20a14a743c63ba953c06439608eb77b27889.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/59c4a28371dcbe3c389101355196268dcf45a2ce.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"2.35","high":"2.43"},"solution":"<p>\n 2.39 (2.35 - 2.43)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/df5705aeeccb83cee2d75b101b9652d461f20d3e.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":16,"type":"NAT","corre